<description>&lt;p&gt;Armed clashes continue in Bangui among government forces, former Séléka rebels and Anti-balaka militias, with foreign actors such as Russian Wagner forces shielding President Touadéra. A planned large-scale militant attack was foiled, showing rebel groups still have capacity to organize major operations. Wagner, Africa Corps and Russian elements are actively protecting the CAR president, indicating deeper foreign involvement. The conflict remains entrenched and destabilising across the country. There were 246 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxQR2VkUk0wRDJ1SlVqemhnekJqVDAtMEtFTUlFU3pydXVvWlN1enV6OF9TNFlzZ2k3dmZoT25KakZ6NjhPcmNZaURkaWY4cWxxUGNVV0tVempSbjhhVGgyaFkwTEQ3cHV0ZS1GYVdNSjFmTzVuZ0R2dWQ1ei1TZ051LWI4N2ZGRVVWd2JQOFVqekU0LWRmcWl3RnNIR1k2TTJZ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxOclU3X19SaDJiZnRBTGN5SVJJTDYycmN1Z2EwRzZPSmoyXzgtM18xV1BCRWFVa2JWUTltMEJ2b2F4MVBvZHgwd1MtZ2xvR1owOTVhY3R1SnNFblhmb25RUGxQNGlaZGJXQmpCODNlX195RTZEUjl4VldadHFRQTJ6TVo4ZFNCVmlxT094VTRtRTJwMmJoNVdJTHdZbXJXM3U2T2ZubE9ZcWd5MkFUQ0JDSl96ZnhQYTg?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxQd0xfOUVteTdXbnh3UUVJOXk0Sk1qeXhyQVhrWndUWGJfMHJZRi1lb1pvMDEwMmNmODFoWUlhZzdkQ3AwZFp5T0U5TDhoc3J2elMzTW1qdGhZVFZTNTFDZ0VLSGNwNUx1ZGdvajZOODllMHlrd3pxNEtYQV85eUNYNWZfNE5fcFc3X05hczdTMmhiUUZIRGl3aU5kMlVtU0ZKV292bEZlNXh2bU5QTXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Africa Report&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTE5zMEsyN0VRd0wxRDNOa096Q0RjN2kyTWZwemlKNjZ4RE9PTlZtYU13V0NSUVR4aTNqMFROcFZadU82SC03d0l3TEFJZ2JNaVhDWW9jUzhvTUs?oc=5&quot;&gt;Israel D